{"5099450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DIEVER", "steam_appid": 5099450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Into the Deep Sea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in a cramped space underwater, wearing a heavy diving suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They command, “If you want to live, aim for the depths.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this a punishment for me, a sinner? Or is it a chance at freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/80527c891ac8fdd4d0c8bf0ef9ee3f53.poster.avif?t=1787136610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/80527c891ac8fdd4d0c8bf0ef9ee3f53.webm?t=1787136610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/80527c891ac8fdd4d0c8bf0ef9ee3f53.mp4?t=1787136610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ A Heavy, Restrictive, and Lonely Struggle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no flashy combos or graceful dodges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You simply stand there, gauge the distance, punch, shoot, and endure. That’s the extent of the back-and-forth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your HP and remaining oxygen, and master this rugged battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/66bf7ac9309aa58498b81ecad43d7284.poster.avif?t=1787136610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/66bf7ac9309aa58498b81ecad43d7284.webm?t=1787136610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/66bf7ac9309aa58498b81ecad43d7284.mp4?t=1787136610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Over 90 types of weapons and armor combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By building your character around base stats and special abilities based on rarity,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can enjoy a different combination every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/acf346d80ffab601b771bb9a7c8cc06c.avif?t=1787136610\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras_big/acf346d80ffab601b771bb9a7c8cc06c.webp?t=1787136610 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ From Human to Something Else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Am I changing my gear, or am I changing my body?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The line between the two grows increasingly blurred the deeper I dive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Into the Deep Sea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in a cramped space underwater, wearing a heavy diving suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They command, “If you want to live, aim for the depths.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this a punishment for me, a sinner? Or is it a chance at freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/80527c891ac8fdd4d0c8bf0ef9ee3f53.poster.avif?t=1787136610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/80527c891ac8fdd4d0c8bf0ef9ee3f53.webm?t=1787136610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/80527c891ac8fdd4d0c8bf0ef9ee3f53.mp4?t=1787136610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ A Heavy, Restrictive, and Lonely Struggle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no flashy combos or graceful dodges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You simply stand there, gauge the distance, punch, shoot, and endure. That’s the extent of the back-and-forth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your HP and remaining oxygen, and master this rugged battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/66bf7ac9309aa58498b81ecad43d7284.poster.avif?t=1787136610\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/66bf7ac9309aa58498b81ecad43d7284.webm?t=1787136610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/66bf7ac9309aa58498b81ecad43d7284.mp4?t=1787136610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Over 90 types of weapons and armor combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By building your character around base stats and special abilities based on rarity,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can enjoy a different combination every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras/acf346d80ffab601b771bb9a7c8cc06c.avif?t=1787136610\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/extras_big/acf346d80ffab601b771bb9a7c8cc06c.webp?t=1787136610 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ From Human to Something Else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Am I changing my gear, or am I changing my body?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The line between the two grows increasingly blurred the deeper I dive.</p>", "short_description": "The pitch-black depths of the ocean, a suffocating sea rendered with a retro aesthetic, a roguelike where you descend while managing oxygen and water pressure. Take down deep-sea creatures with heavy blows and strategic spacing, and transform your body with over 90 types of gear.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/5b070da990d79099d8fd3b07aad21c3700da6cd7/header.jpg?t=1787136610", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/7fd718922f4d442437ca928299958f1f26d58967/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787136610", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5099450/7fd718922f4d442437ca928299958f1f26d58967/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787136610", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4340 / AMD FX-6300 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics with DirectX 11 support<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating syst